    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111536" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλότεχν-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fond of</i>
			
			<i>art</i> or <i>an art, artistic,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				476a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.41f
